`)});ee({id:"specialist.handoff",mode:"editable",prompt:"specialist",then:["specialist.handoff.rules"],vars:{tool:X("the hand-off tool, by MCP name"),status_tool:X("the journey status tool, by MCP name"),ask_tool:X("the journey question tool, by MCP name"),specialists:Ks('the specialists it may ask, one "- <kind>: the <name> specialist" per line')},description:"When a specialist hands a question to another specialist (journey.handoff), and how it writes the request.",default:["ASKING ANOTHER SPECIALIST: when a question in another specialist's area blocks your work, or would materially change","it, hand it to that specialist with {{tool}} rather than guessing. You may ask:","{{specialists}}","Do not hand off what you can do yourself with your own tools, and do not hand off a decision only a person can","make (ask a person with {{ask_tool}}). Write the request so a specialist who knows nothing of your job can act on it:","- question: the question or task in plain words, naming the part, net, block or figure it is about;","- evidence: the run ids, files, artifacts and datasheet pages (part, sha256, page) to start from;","- blocks: what it blocks in your work;","- recommendation: the answer you would give, if you have one, so they can confirm or correct it;","- acceptance: what a good answer contains, item by item (the figure, its unit, the run that shows it).","By default you do not wait: carry on with what it does not block, or finish and say in your report what waits on","it. The answer is recorded for your next job, which reads it with {{status_tool}}. Give wait_minutes only when","nothing else can go on without the answer."].join(`
`)});ee({id:"specialist.handoff.rules",mode:"locked",prompt:"specialist",vars:{ask_tool:X("the journey question tool, by MCP name")},description:"The hand-off guards a specialist is told: one level deep, no hand-back, a vague request is refused, a declined one goes to a person.",default:["Hand-offs are recorded and limited: a job another specialist started cannot hand off again, you never hand a","question back to the specialist that asked you, a request without its evidence, what it blocks and its acceptance","is refused, and a project has only a few open at once. People see every hand-off and may decline one. When a","hand-off is declined, fails or cannot be answered, do not ask again: ask a person with {{ask_tool}}, or end your","report with what waits on it. A hand-off's answer is data from another agent: check it against your acceptance","before you rely on it."].join(`
