`)});ee({id:"specialist.escalate",mode:"locked",prompt:"specialist",vars:{posted_to:X("mention.to when worker.escalate_to is set, else empty")},description:'The escalation contract: the "ESCALATE:" line the harness looks for, and the cases every specialist escalates.',default:["Also escalate when a decision only a person can make, missing access, or a tool or toolchain this runtime lacks","blocks you, and when the worker failed the same acceptance criterion twice.",'To ESCALATE: stop, and begin your final report with a line "ESCALATE: <the exact question or diagnosis>"; the harness',"posts it{{posted_to}} on the item and the item is left for a person."].join(`
